### GET all products V1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/V1/products
Accept: application/json

### GET product by SKU V1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/V1/products/P001
Accept: application/json

### POST create product V1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/V1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "P005",
  "name": "Produit 5",
  "price": 50.0,
  "stock": 500
}

### DELETE product V1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/V1/products/P005
